        "1408": { n: "Setting/bearing blocks", t: "GOST 30971-2012 G.1.4: material — polymer with hardness of at least 80 Shore A or impregnated hardwood; recommended block length 100–120 mm; number and placement — per process documentation. Internal company standard (not set in the GOST): wood and foam are prohibited (stricter than the GOST); width ≥40 mm; height 15–30 mm; spacing ≤600 mm (aluminium profiles) / ≤400 mm (heavy IGUs); offset from corner ≤150 mm; mandatory under all vertical mullions and transoms. TS; WEP" },
