        "1615": { n: "Requirements for foam application", t: "Installation gaps - 20-60 mm, minimum - 10-20 mm (GOST 30971-2012, cl.5.2.1, Table 2). Filling depth: not less than 60% of the joint width (to avoid voids). Uniform filling. GOST 30971-2012 cl.6.6 No voids, cavities, gaps. Protect the foam from UV rays as soon as possible" },
