        "1819": { n: "Temperature-humidity regime", t: "SP 71.13330.2017 cl. 8.1.6, 8.1.7: temperature not below +10°C (maintain for at least 24 hours after completion of work), air humidity ≤60%. Range +18°C to +25°C and humidity 40-60% — internal company standard (manufacturer's requirement)" },
